OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AHow long will humans be needed for
OL,4,Atranslation?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe says a well-trained system will know
OL,7,Fthat ropes are not literally falling
OL,8,Ffrom the sky and use the English phrase
OL,9,F"it's raining cats and dogs".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
