OL,3,AIs it OK for jobseekers or employers to
OL,4,Ause AI?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWould you use AI to help you write a CV
OL,7,For cover letter? How about during an
OL,8,Fonline assessment or video interview
OL,9,Ffor a job?
OL,11,FWe are increasingly using the
OL,12,Ftechnology to help us with job
OL,13,Fapplications, graduates and recruiters
OL,14,Fsay, with many employers happy for us
OL,15,Fto do so within reason.
OL,17,FBut when does it cross a line from
OL,18,Fbeing acceptable to unethical, or even
OL,19,Fcheating?
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
