OL,3,ABumble bought for $1.3bn in 'bet on the
OL,4,Afuture of humanity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhitney Wolfe Herd, Bumble's founder
OL,7,Fand current chief executive, said she
OL,8,Fwould remain "actively involved" with
OL,9,Fthe business she set up 12 years ago.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
